  "label": "Racial Stereotype: Watermelon and Fried Chicken",
  "description": "This stereotype portrays Black individuals as inherently associated with certain foods, such as watermelon and fried chicken. In this meme, the man’s formal attire and serious expression contrast with the absurd accusation of farting, which can be interpreted as a mockery of his perceived 'unrefined' or 'unworthy' qualities. The meme relies on the viewer’s implicit understanding of this stereotype to generate its humor, which is rooted in racial prejudice.",
